---
// Decorative marble veining echoing the logo's stone.
// The artwork lives in two generated SVG tiles under /img (see
// scripts/gen_veins.py): a crack network of tapered, branching veins with a
// warm haze and a mottled stone field, faded out from its own corner so the
// tile never shows an edge. Kept as external files rather than inline markup —
// they are ~50 KB each and would otherwise be repeated in all 18 pages.
// Inert to pointer events and behind every content layer.
---
<div class="veins" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="veins-tl"></span>
  <span class="veins-br"></span>
</div>
